        h1 Tags
        p By default, text at the start of a line (or after only white space) represents an HTML tag. Indented tags are nested, creating the tree structure of HTML.
        div.preview-wrapper(data-control="interactive", data-index="0")
          div.row(data-reactroot, data-reactid="1", data-react-checksum="-120943139")
            div.col-lg-6(data-reactid="2")
              div(data-reactid="3")
                textarea(data-reactid="4").
                  ul
                    li Item A
                    li Item B
                    li Item C
            div.col-lg-6(data-reactid="5")
              div(data-reactid="6")
                textarea(readonly, data-reactid="7").
                  <ul>
                    <li>Item A</li>
                    <li>Item B</li>
                    <li>Item C</li>
                  </ul>
        p Pug also knows which elements are self-closing:
        div.preview-wrapper(data-control="interactive", data-index="1")
          div.row(data-reactroot, data-reactid="1", data-react-checksum="883975827")
            div.col-lg-6(data-reactid="2")
